---
const steps = [
  { title: 'Set up in a minute', body: 'A short first-run wizard: pick your hotkey, your replay length and where clips should go.' },
  { title: 'Just play', body: 'rewynd sits in your system tray and stays out of the way. The buffer is always running.' },
  { title: 'Press F10', body: 'The last 60 seconds become an MP4 in your clips folder, starting cleanly, ready to share.' },
];
---
<section class="sec" id="how"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
  <h2>Set it up once, then forget it exists</h2>
  <div class="cards3">
    {steps.map((s, i) => (
      <div class="card"><div class="num">{i + 1}</div><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.body}</p></div>
    ))}
  </div>
</div></section>
